       en="The **imperfect** (παρατατικός) shows an action that went on or was repeated: *δούλευε στο νησί τέσσερα χρόνια*. The **aorist** (αόριστος) shows a completed event: *βρήκε επιγραφές*. That is exactly the point Vlachopoulos made about the inscription: the continuous verb implies an ongoing relationship.",
